    "title": "Bangkok to Ayutthaya Luxury Weekend: Sala Ayutthaya, River Cruises & Private Temple Tours",
    "excerpt": "Ayutthaya's ancient ruins are spectacular at any budget, but experiencing them with a private historian, riverside fine dining, and a pool villa overlooking the Chao Phraya transforms the trip entirely.",
    "date": "2026-05-07",
    "author": "Luxury Family Travel Asia Team",
